**The simplified flow:**

```
Expense Report Submitted → Log Submission Received → Manager Approval → Log Outcome → Done
```

The `Log Outcome` script handles both outcomes in one place: it reads `$vars.managerApproval.status`, writes `APPROVED` or `REJECTED` into the log message, and appends the rejection reason only when the decision was Reject.

